<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
  What the launcher is told about the widget.

  android:configure names the chooser. There are many Events, so a copy has to be
  told which one it shows: dropping it opens the chooser, and the Event picked
  there is the one that copy counts to for as long as it is on the home screen
  (ADR-0009). Placement is two steps because of it. The name is spelled out in
  full because this is a component name rather than a class in some package this
  file knows about.

  There is no widgetFeatures="reconfigurable": Android's reconfigurable widgets
  are 12 and up while minSdk is 26, so half the supported range could not have
  it. Removing the copy and placing another does the same thing.

  updatePeriodMillis is 0 — nothing here runs on a timer. The app redraws the
  widget when the Event changes, and midnight is a separate job.

  It is resizable both ways, and 2x2 both as it lands and as small as it goes.
  110dp is two cells on the usual grid; it matches MIN_WIDGET_SIZE_DP in
  WidgetSizing.kt, which is the size the Dial falls back to when a launcher
  reports nothing. There is no maximum: the Dial is drawn again at whatever size
  the widget is dragged to.

  The picker is given a preview twice over. previewLayout is the modern one and
  is drawn at the size the widget will land at, but it is Android 12 and up;
  minSdk is 26, so previewImage is what everything older reads. Both show the
  same drawing of the Dial, because the real one is a bitmap rendered on a
  device and there is no widget yet to render it for.
-->
<appwidget-provider xmlns:android="http://schemas.android.com/apk/res/android"
    android:configure="ninja.notnot.countdown.ChooseEventActivity"
    android:description="@string/widget_description"
    android:initialLayout="@layout/widget_dial"
    android:minHeight="110dp"
    android:minResizeHeight="110dp"
    android:minResizeWidth="110dp"
    android:minWidth="110dp"
    android:previewImage="@drawable/dial_preview"
    android:previewLayout="@layout/widget_dial_preview"
    android:resizeMode="horizontal|vertical"
    android:targetCellHeight="2"
    android:targetCellWidth="2"
    android:updatePeriodMillis="0"
    android:widgetCategory="home_screen" />
